---
const title = 'ページが見つかりません | ChuniSupport Docs'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="status">404</p>
      <h1>ページが見つかりません</h1>
      <p>お探しのページは移動または削除された可能性があります。</p>
      <a href="/">トップへ戻る</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans', 'Noto Sans JP', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    background: #fff;
    color: #111827;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
  }

  main {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: grid;
    min-block-size: 100vh;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: start;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .status {
    margin: 0;
    color: #16a34a;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-block: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  p {
    max-inline-size: 50rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: #16a34a;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    background: #15803d;
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #22c55e;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      background: #03150f;
      color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .status {
      color: #4ade80;
    }
  }
</style>
